# Each implementation directory (gbdk/, rgbds/) keeps its own
# .gitignore for build artifacts specific to its own toolchain. This
# root one is for editor/OS cruft, plus the couple of things shared
# across every implementation (see README.md):
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Local emulator working directory (e.g. a BGB install) -- shared by
# every implementation, not GBDK-specific.
/emulador

# Real captured Mobile Adapter configuration (account data) used as a
# host-test fixture and as the ROM's live ISP identity source. Not
# provided -- see README.md/docs/testing.md for provisioning it.
config.bin
